$ diva run max.ml
2
[exit 0]

$ diva check max.ml
no runtime error is possible
[exit 0]

$ diva opt max.ml
(let max = (fun a -> (fun b -> (if (a < b) then b else a))) in ((max 1) 2))
[exit 0]

$ diva hints max.ml
a#0 : 1
b#1 : 2
[exit 0]

$ diva cert --check max.ml
[diva] running Lean on max.lean
wrote max.lean
certificate checked by Lean: the program never fails
[exit 0]

$ diva prove --check -o prove.lean max.ml
[diva] running Lean on prove.lean
wrote prove.lean
checked by Lean: the functions meet their contracts, and the top-level expressions don't fail
[exit 0]

